      "excerpt": "# Catering Margins\nTarget 70% gross margins for corporate catering packages.\n\n---\n\n## \ud83e\udde0 J.A.R.V.I.S. Expanded Understanding & Neural Synthesis\n* **Core Semantic Insight:** The strict adherence to a 70% gross margin target for Pixel Bloom Studios' corporate catering packages signifies a strategic pivot from volume chasing to high-value positioning, ensuring that operational bandwidth directly correlates with elite profitability.\n* **Operational Context:** Whenever catering logistics, pricing structures, or client proposals are under review, I shall proactively audit projected financials against this 70% benchmark, flagging any margin compression before negotiations advance.\n* **Cross-Domain Links:** This financial threshold bridges **Finance** (margin optimization) with **Operations** (resource allocation and vendor management) and **Marketing** (justifying premium pricing through bespoke, high-end brand perception for corporate clientele).\n"
