      "z": -79.6,
      "excerpt": "# Social Media Strategy\n\nBloom & Brew's social media presence is our primary marketing engine. Our unique combination of coffee and flowers creates highly visual, shareable content that performs exceptionally well on Instagram and TikTok.\n\n## Platforms & Posting Cadence\n\n| Platform | Posts/Week | Content Type |\n|----------|-----------|--------------|\n| Instagram | 5-7 | Reels, carousel, stories |\n| TikTok | 3-4 | Behind-the-scenes, tutorials |\n| Facebook | 2-3 | Events, community posts |\n| Pinterest | 5+ | Product pins, mood boards |\n\n## Content Pillars\n\n1. **Behind the Bloom** \u2014 Process videos showing floral arrangement creation\n2. **Bean to Cup** \u2014 Coffee sourcing and brewing content (ties into [[Supplier Relationships]] stories)\n3. **Studio Life** \u2014 Day-in-the-life of the [[Team Roster]] members\n4. **Customer Spotlight** \u2014 UGC and testimonials from our [[Customer Feedback Program]]\n5. **Seasonal Magic** \u2014 Content aligned with [[Seasonal Campaigns]]\n\n## Engagement Strategy\n\n- Respond to all comments within 2 hours during business hours\n- Share user-generated content at least twice weekly\n- Collaborate with local influencers monthly (see [[Partnership Opportunities]])\n- Use our [[Brand Guidelines]] consistently across all platforms\n\n## Metrics\n\nWe track follower growth, engagement rate, and conversion to store visits. Monthly reports feed into the [[Quarterly Business Review]]. Our [[Email Marketing]] list growth is partially driven by social media CTAs.\n\n## Budget\n\nSocial media ad spend is allocated in [[Budget Planning]]. We typically boost our best-performing organic posts rather than running cold ads.\n\n---\n\n## \ud83e\udde0 J.A.R.V.I.S. Expanded Understanding & Neural Synthesis\n* **Core Semantic Insight:** For Pixel Bloom Studios, social media is not merely a promotional outlet but the digital storefront of our brand ethos\u2014effectively monetizing the aesthetic synergy between artisan coffee and floral design through high-velocity, highly visual storytelling.\n* **Operational Context:** When this topic arises, I shall assist Thenuja by optimizing content scheduling, drafting high-conversion captions, tracking cross-platform engagement metrics, and ensuring alignment with our brand voice and quarterly business objectives.\n* **Cross-Domain Links:** This strategy acts as a vital nexus connecting **Marketing** (Brand Guidelines, Email Marketing, Seasonal Campaigns) directly to **Operations** (Team Roster, Supplier Relationships), **Finance** (Budget Planning, Quarterly Business Review), and external growth vectors (Partnership Opportunities).\n"
