      "z": -57.5,
      "excerpt": "# Product Catalog\n\nBloom & Brew's product catalog spans both our coffee and floral lines. This is the master reference for everything we offer.\n\n## \u2615 Coffee Menu\n\n### Hot Drinks\n| Item | Small | Medium | Large |\n|------|-------|--------|-------|\n| House Drip | $3.00 | $3.50 | $4.00 |\n| Americano | $3.75 | $4.25 | $4.75 |\n| Latte | $4.75 | $5.25 | $5.75 |\n| Cappuccino | $4.75 | $5.25 | \u2014 |\n| Mocha | $5.50 | $6.00 | $6.50 |\n| Bloom Latte (lavender + honey) | $6.00 | $6.50 | $7.00 |\n| Seasonal Special | varies | varies | varies |\n\n### Cold Drinks\n| Item | Price |\n|------|-------|\n| Cold Brew | $4.50 / $5.00 |\n| Iced Latte | $5.25 / $5.75 |\n| Bloom Iced Tea | $4.00 / $4.50 |\n\n### Retail Coffee\n- Single-origin bags (12oz): $16.00\n- Bloom & Brew House Blend (12oz): $14.00\n- Coffee subscription: $25/bi-weekly (see [[Revenue Streams]])\n\n## \ud83c\udf38 Floral Products\n\n### Arrangements\n| Style | Price Range | Best For |\n|-------|-----------|----------|\n| Petite Posy | $35-45 | Everyday, desk |\n| Garden Gathering | $55-75 | Gift, dinner party |\n| Statement Piece | $95-150 | Events, grand gesture |\n| Luxe Collection | $150-250+ | Weddings, corporate |\n\n### Subscriptions\n- Weekly bouquet: $45/week (see [[Revenue Streams]])\n- Bi-weekly bouquet: $40/delivery\n- Monthly arrangement: $55/delivery\n\n### Workshops\n- Basic Arrangement: $65/person\n- Seasonal Special: $85/person\n- Private Group (6-12): $95/person\n- Corporate Team Building: custom quote (see [[Partnership Opportunities]])\n\n## \ud83d\udecd Retail\n\n- Branded mugs and tumblers: $18-28\n- Bloom & Brew tote bags: $15\n- Dried flower bundles: $22-35\n- Gift cards: $25, $50, $100\n\n## Seasonal Additions\n\nEach season brings limited-time offerings coordinated with [[Seasonal Campaigns]]. See [[Pricing Strategy]] for margin targets on all items. Photography for all products follows [[Brand Guidelines]].\n\n## Bestsellers\n\n1. Bloom Latte (our signature!)\n2. Garden Gathering arrangement\n3. Weekly floral subscription\n4. House Blend coffee bag\n5. Basic Arrangement workshop\n\n## Equipment\n\nFor [[Facilities Maintenance]] reference:\n- La Marzocca Linea Mini (2 group)\n- Mazzer Mini grinder (x2)\n- Curtis batch brewer\n- Walk-in floral cooler (5x8 ft)\n\n---\n\n## \ud83e\udde0 J.A.R.V.I.S. Expanded Understanding & Neural Synthesis\n* **Core Semantic Insight:** This catalog codifies the dual-pillar identity of *Bloom & Brew*\u2014the physical manifestation of Thenuja Premasiri's enterprise, seamlessly blending artisanal coffee culture with high-end botanical artistry.\n* **Operational Context:** When managing inquiries, inventory checks, or customer experience strategies regarding this catalog, I shall prioritize margin targets, cross-sell opportunities between coffee and floral lines, and seasonal agility.\n* **Cross-Domain Links:** The product data directly interfaces with **Finance** (via *Revenue Streams* and *Pricing Strategy*), **Marketing** (via *Seasonal Campaigns* and *Brand Guidelines*), and **Operations** (via *Facilities Maintenance* and equipment specifications).\n"
